WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.020
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.290 --> 00:29.370
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.540 --> 00:33.000
[Episode 1]

4
00:33.110 --> 00:34.810
[Year 2000]

5
00:51.110 --> 00:52.670
The heavens stretch beyond sight.

6
00:52.670 --> 00:54.110
The earth lies deep in shadow.

7
00:54.110 --> 00:55.110
Let the Eight Winds show the way.

8
00:55.110 --> 00:56.470
Let the Lord of Fate descend.

9
00:56.470 --> 00:57.790
Incense smoke rises in seal-script patterns.

10
00:57.790 --> 00:58.920
The ritual drum calls to the spirits.

11
00:58.920 --> 01:00.110
This disciple humbly beseeches you.

12
01:00.110 --> 01:02.310
Let all things reveal their true forms.

13
01:04.430 --> 01:05.230
Cursed bonds.

14
01:05.760 --> 01:06.520
Countless cursed bonds

15
01:06.520 --> 01:07.280
have been reborn through you.

16
01:07.280 --> 01:07.950
Again and again,

17
01:07.950 --> 01:09.080
with no end in sight.

18
01:10.240 --> 01:11.120
The cursed bond that has endured

19
01:11.120 --> 01:12.370
through countless lives

20
01:12.370 --> 01:13.840
has turned into resentment.

21
01:13.840 --> 01:15.120
Now that this resentment clings to you,

22
01:15.120 --> 01:16.720
you cannot escape your doom.

23
01:18.710 --> 01:20.350
Will I die?

24
01:20.600 --> 01:21.789
Of course.

25
01:22.280 --> 01:23.200
Scared now?

26
01:23.220 --> 01:25.650
I can perform rituals to drive out evil spirits.

27
01:25.650 --> 01:26.710
I charge this much.

28
01:43.200 --> 01:46.600
Are you talking about me?

29
01:49.710 --> 01:51.320
Supreme Lord Lao, heed my command!

30
01:51.320 --> 01:52.340
Begone! Disperse!

31
01:52.340 --> 01:53.150
Don't come any closer.

32
01:53.150 --> 01:53.640
Don't come any closer!

33
01:53.640 --> 01:54.280
Don't come any closer!

34
01:54.280 --> 01:55.070
Let go of me!

35
01:55.280 --> 01:56.479
Supreme Lord Lao, save me!

36
01:56.479 --> 01:59.229
Let go of me! Let go!

37
01:59.789 --> 02:01.510
Go away! Don't touch me!

38
02:08.740 --> 02:10.460
You little fraud.

39
02:11.590 --> 02:12.990
Your acting is terrible.

40
02:13.000 --> 02:14.350
And you're a coward too.

41
02:17.260 --> 02:18.390
You tricked me!

42
02:18.420 --> 02:19.810
You'll pay for this someday.

43
02:19.810 --> 02:20.650
Pay for it?

44
02:24.070 --> 02:27.530
Only those who will be reincarnated have to fear retribution.

45
02:28.860 --> 02:29.990
Where's Chen Xiugu?

46
02:31.120 --> 02:32.250
Tell her to come out.

47
02:33.010 --> 02:33.920
My grandma?

48
02:33.940 --> 02:34.800
She's not here.

49
02:35.240 --> 02:36.190
Who are you?

50
02:36.430 --> 02:37.430
Song Yiqiu.

51
02:37.800 --> 02:40.260
I've come to collect what I asked her to find.

52
02:49.930 --> 02:50.850
Come with me.

53
03:16.000 --> 03:16.520
You...

54
03:16.870 --> 03:17.560
You...

55
03:18.960 --> 03:20.220
The person in the photo

56
03:20.470 --> 03:22.680
standing beside my grandma...

57
03:23.120 --> 03:24.520
It's you.

58
03:24.680 --> 03:25.730
But that photo

59
03:25.860 --> 03:27.860
was taken when my grandma was young.

60
03:28.100 --> 03:29.560
That was over 70 years ago.

61
03:30.230 --> 03:31.340
Could it be that the person I just saw

62
03:31.340 --> 03:33.070
was you from the same lifetime?

63
03:33.870 --> 03:35.800
How can you possibly not have aged?

64
03:37.070 --> 03:37.700
You...

65
03:38.130 --> 03:39.620
Are you human or a ghost?

66
03:44.620 --> 03:46.020
Don't make such a fuss.

67
03:51.140 --> 03:52.530
You're so young.

68
03:52.560 --> 03:54.040
Cut back on those smoke cakes.

69
03:54.040 --> 03:55.640
They're bad for your health.

70
03:57.720 --> 03:59.160
Take this money.

71
04:00.740 --> 04:02.430
And don't trick people again.

72
04:04.720 --> 04:06.130
Tell Xiugu

73
04:06.160 --> 04:07.290
I got what I came for.

74
04:07.300 --> 04:08.610
I'll come by for tea another day.

75
04:08.610 --> 04:10.210
I don't think I was mistaken.

76
04:11.190 --> 04:12.490
Your face bears the mark of death.

77
04:12.490 --> 04:14.820
The face of someone who is destined to die.

78
04:19.680 --> 04:21.240
Thank you for your concern.

79
04:22.089 --> 04:24.020
I truly don't want to live anymore.

80
04:27.870 --> 04:29.550
But I can't die yet.

81
04:30.120 --> 04:31.720
If I die, I'll have to see him.

82
04:32.430 --> 04:33.510
Some people

83
04:34.060 --> 04:35.390
are better left unseen.

84
04:44.010 --> 04:47.460
[72 years ago]

85
04:47.490 --> 04:47.880
Here.

86
04:48.290 --> 04:48.920
Try it.

87
04:48.659 --> 04:50.409
[Chen Xiugu]

88
04:49.320 --> 04:50.180
It's fresh tea.

89
04:51.020 --> 04:53.090
It is said that during the reign of Southern Qin,

90
04:53.090 --> 04:55.080
an ancient tree attained spiritual consciousness.

91
04:55.080 --> 04:56.200
Its tree core

92
04:56.230 --> 04:57.870
was said to possess the power to grant immortality.

93
04:57.870 --> 04:58.720
And then?

94
04:58.750 --> 05:00.610
There was a couple deeply in love.

95
05:01.250 --> 05:02.520
By a twist of fate,

96
05:02.630 --> 05:04.340
they formed a pact with that tree spirit.

97
05:04.340 --> 05:06.270
The tree spirit sealed their years

98
05:06.360 --> 05:08.170
within a sacred map.

99
05:08.510 --> 05:10.750
And the two became immortal.

100
05:11.630 --> 05:12.480
Xiugu,

101
05:13.040 --> 05:15.510
help me find a way to end this immortality.

102
05:15.770 --> 05:16.440
All right.

103
05:29.130 --> 05:31.010
For Miss Yiqiu.

104
05:31.560 --> 05:34.020
To break free from the bonds of immortality,

105
05:34.080 --> 05:36.350
you must find the map of the pact.

106
05:36.870 --> 05:39.400
Yet the osmanthus tree has a spirit of its own.

107
05:40.190 --> 05:44.040
Only when the two who made the pact are connected in heart and soul

108
05:44.159 --> 05:45.890
and return to where it all began

109
05:46.159 --> 05:48.190
will the map reveal itself.

110
05:48.800 --> 05:50.070
Where it all began.

111
05:53.430 --> 05:55.030
Xiugu.

112
05:56.540 --> 05:57.430
That person and I

113
05:57.430 --> 05:59.159
are the two people in this world

114
05:59.760 --> 06:02.290
least likely to ever return to where we began.

115
06:02.360 --> 06:04.570
Welcome to FM 23.3,

116
06:04.600 --> 06:06.070
City Life Radio.

117
06:06.070 --> 06:06.720
No need to pick me up.

118
06:06.720 --> 06:09.430
Tonight, we are about to witness a rare blood moon.

119
06:09.430 --> 06:12.120
It happens to coincide with the city's grand fireworks show.

120
06:12.120 --> 06:14.510
Let's witness this moment together.

121
06:15.360 --> 06:16.070
Ten.

122
06:16.360 --> 06:17.070
Nine.

123
06:17.360 --> 06:18.070
Eight.

124
06:18.430 --> 06:19.000
Seven.

125
06:19.510 --> 06:20.120
Six.

126
06:20.630 --> 06:21.310
Five.

127
06:21.750 --> 06:22.310
Four.

128
06:22.750 --> 06:23.310
Three.

129
06:23.750 --> 06:24.310
Two.

130
06:24.720 --> 06:25.270
One.

131
07:05.270 --> 07:06.740
Hello, is this 120?

132
07:06.880 --> 07:08.470
There's been a traffic accident

133
07:08.470 --> 07:09.530
at this intersection downtown.

134
07:09.530 --> 07:10.680
Someone's been injured.

135
07:10.680 --> 07:13.860
And there's a pregnant woman who looks like she's about to give birth.

136
07:13.860 --> 07:15.500
That little fraud.

137
07:16.490 --> 07:18.490
She's got some tricks up her sleeve.

138
07:40.630 --> 07:41.310
Make way.

139
07:41.640 --> 07:42.320
Quick!

140
07:43.170 --> 07:44.320
Prepare the trauma room.

141
07:44.320 --> 07:45.780
Severe traffic accident.

142
07:45.870 --> 07:47.380
Female patient is unconscious.

143
07:47.380 --> 07:48.240
Multiple fractures,

144
07:48.240 --> 07:49.640
with internal bleeding.

145
07:50.120 --> 07:51.940
Get OB-GYN down here for an emergency consult.

146
07:51.940 --> 07:53.560
Full-term patient with premature rupture of membranes.

147
07:53.560 --> 07:54.360
Transfer her to the delivery room immediately.

148
07:54.360 --> 07:55.159
This way.

149
07:56.150 --> 07:58.550
Don't stop. Keep doing chest compressions.

150
07:58.550 --> 08:01.110
Patient has severe trauma and hemorrhagic shock.

151
08:01.110 --> 08:01.990
Move faster.

152
08:06.670 --> 08:09.130
We still can't get a blood pressure reading.

153
08:10.690 --> 08:11.610
The monitor.

154
08:14.120 --> 08:15.600
Vital signs are gone.

155
08:21.900 --> 08:22.930
Her heart rate is back.

156
08:22.930 --> 08:24.410
Spontaneous cardiac rhythm.

157
08:24.410 --> 08:25.070
How is that possible?

158
08:25.070 --> 08:25.600
Her wounds...

159
08:25.600 --> 08:27.310
They're healing on their own.

160
08:28.000 --> 08:29.000
H-How is that possible?

161
08:29.000 --> 08:30.260
How could this happen?

162
08:33.120 --> 08:33.850
She's alive!

163
08:34.030 --> 08:34.700
A monster.

164
08:34.820 --> 08:35.780
What a nuisance.

165
10:10.110 --> 10:12.840
♪ Because I look up to the sky, thinking about you ♪

166
10:14.600 --> 10:17.540
♪ Hoping to start anew, and journey through with you ♪

167
10:19.540 --> 10:22.570
♪ If we're destined to fall ♪

168
10:21.000 --> 10:22.000
Just ahead.

169
10:22.680 --> 10:23.280
Okay.

170
10:26.710 --> 10:29.040
♪ I'll be there beside you ♪

171
10:29.070 --> 10:31.790
♪ Because I look up to the sky, thinking about you ♪

172
10:33.480 --> 10:36.790
♪ Hoping to start anew, and journey through with you ♪

173
10:38.270 --> 10:42.080
♪ If we're destined to fall ♪

174
10:43.560 --> 10:44.370
Wait.

175
10:59.030 --> 11:00.360
As long as they're safe.

176
11:46.910 --> 11:47.880
Long time no see,

177
11:48.280 --> 11:49.090
Song Yiqiu.

178
11:51.940 --> 11:52.980
Is it?

179
11:54.620 --> 11:56.220
Has it really been that long?

180
11:56.690 --> 11:59.210
Seventy-two years and thirty-seven days.

181
12:00.380 --> 12:02.310
For an ordinary person, 72 years

182
12:02.340 --> 12:03.460
is a lifetime.

183
12:04.870 --> 12:07.460
But for you and me, after living 3,000 years,

184
12:07.950 --> 12:09.950
it's nothing but a fleeting moment.

185
12:14.650 --> 12:15.580
What?

186
12:16.370 --> 12:17.740
Miss me already?

187
12:19.850 --> 12:21.000
I'm just marveling.

188
12:22.000 --> 12:24.540
You managed to stay alive for that long without dying.

189
12:24.540 --> 12:26.370
I suppose the world has been too good.

190
12:26.370 --> 12:28.600
So you've encountered too few misfortunes.

191
12:28.600 --> 12:30.240
Miss Meddler.

192
12:42.700 --> 12:44.070
You just died once.

193
12:44.360 --> 12:45.490
Whenever one of us dies,

194
12:45.490 --> 12:47.850
we appear by the other's side.

195
12:48.220 --> 12:49.530
Could it be

196
12:49.870 --> 12:50.920
that I've simply grown tired

197
12:50.920 --> 12:53.920
of looking at the same face you've had for 3,000 years?

198
12:54.870 --> 12:55.820
Song Yiqiu.

199
12:57.810 --> 12:58.850
Ning Changyue.

200
12:59.860 --> 13:01.180
Long time no see.

201
13:03.160 --> 13:04.510
Do you dare to experience the feeling of falling

202
13:04.510 --> 13:05.880
with me one more time?

203
13:08.270 --> 13:10.200
Someone's holding a wedding here today.

204
13:10.200 --> 13:10.960
It's a joyous occasion.

205
13:10.960 --> 13:13.090
Don't die on someone else's doorstep.

206
13:34.580 --> 13:36.510
Three thousand years have passed.

207
13:36.830 --> 13:38.950
Every story has reached its ending.

208
13:39.780 --> 13:40.990
Except ours.

209
13:41.860 --> 13:44.370
We became prisoners forgotten by time.

210
13:46.600 --> 13:48.030
Long, long ago,

211
13:48.970 --> 13:51.100
I thought immortality was a blessing.

212
13:52.080 --> 13:55.200
But after countless encounters with desolate graves,

213
13:55.370 --> 13:57.220
heart-wrenching farewells,

214
13:57.410 --> 13:59.610
and the agony of dying only to be reborn,

215
14:00.450 --> 14:01.650
I finally understood

216
14:02.610 --> 14:03.400
immortality

217
14:04.270 --> 14:06.220
is a curse with no escape.

218
14:13.640 --> 14:15.610
Granny Xiugu.

219
14:14.440 --> 14:16.370
[Three months later]

220
14:24.790 --> 14:26.740
Why is she wearing red?

221
14:39.840 --> 14:40.870
It's you.

222
14:44.050 --> 14:45.210
I never thought

223
14:45.430 --> 14:47.890
we'd meet again under these circumstances.

224
14:57.870 --> 14:59.030
Xiugu.

225
15:00.240 --> 15:02.860
I still remember you telling me when you were little

226
15:02.860 --> 15:05.720
that you loved this robe of mine more than anything.

227
15:06.790 --> 15:08.850
Too bad you became a fortune-teller.

228
15:09.550 --> 15:12.010
You were never meant to wear red in this life.

229
15:33.360 --> 15:34.200
Xiugu.

230
15:34.770 --> 15:36.720
This robe is yours now.

231
15:37.670 --> 15:38.670
In your next life,

232
15:39.380 --> 15:41.300
wear whatever color you like.

233
15:54.920 --> 15:57.520
Granny Xiugu, may you go peacefully.

234
16:01.240 --> 16:02.500
Three thousand years,

235
16:02.930 --> 16:05.970
and you've witnessed so many births, deaths, and separations.

236
16:05.970 --> 16:07.830
And yet you can still feel sorrow.

237
16:11.240 --> 16:12.670
I'm not like you.

238
16:13.460 --> 16:15.860
After all, your heart holds only yourself.

239
16:16.250 --> 16:18.450
You have never cared about anyone else.

240
16:19.840 --> 16:23.030
To you, all living things are no more than ants.

241
16:24.200 --> 16:27.030
Whether they live or die makes no difference.

242
16:28.680 --> 16:30.340
There isn't much that I can fit

243
16:32.130 --> 16:33.100
in my heart.

244
16:42.000 --> 16:42.870
Not like you.

245
16:43.800 --> 16:45.750
Your country, your people, the whole world,

246
16:45.750 --> 16:47.550
every common soul under heaven,

247
16:48.720 --> 16:51.120
even every stray cat and dog by the roadside...

248
16:51.120 --> 16:53.450
Is there anything you could ever let go of?

249
16:56.960 --> 16:59.120
Sometimes I truly can't understand

250
17:01.120 --> 17:03.920
how I ever ended up jumping off that cliff with you.

251
17:06.530 --> 17:07.329
Yeah.

252
17:08.920 --> 17:09.680
Why

253
17:11.000 --> 17:12.260
was it me of all people?

254
17:19.000 --> 17:21.069
The princess has fled with her guard.

255
17:21.510 --> 17:23.160
The emperor has ordered her capture.

256
17:22.829 --> 17:26.520
[3,000 years ago]

257
17:23.160 --> 17:24.750
Dead or alive.

258
17:25.720 --> 17:26.440
After them!

259
17:27.990 --> 17:28.800
Watch out!

260
17:30.920 --> 17:32.000
Quick, there!

261
17:33.750 --> 17:35.480
That's a cliff. They can't escape now.

262
17:35.480 --> 17:36.070
Let's go!

263
17:36.240 --> 17:36.920
Hurry!

264
17:49.030 --> 17:50.160
Are you afraid?

265
17:50.730 --> 17:52.190
As long as I'm by your side,

266
17:52.410 --> 17:54.140
I have nothing left to wish for.

267
17:59.530 --> 18:00.480
Song Yiqiu,

268
18:01.480 --> 18:02.830
from this day forward,

269
18:04.090 --> 18:06.480
from the heavens above to the depths below,

270
18:06.480 --> 18:07.960
may it always be you and me,

271
18:08.880 --> 18:10.110
never to part.

272
18:11.750 --> 18:12.750
We

273
18:13.790 --> 18:15.160
will never part.

274
18:30.990 --> 18:34.670
♪ I'd forsake immortality to share your joys and sorrows ♪

275
18:34.690 --> 18:37.640
♪ Who cares how absurd eternity may be ♪

276
18:37.670 --> 18:43.220
♪ I'd trade this life for eternity ♪

277
18:43.360 --> 18:47.910
♪ Then we'd be complete ♪

278
18:45.830 --> 18:46.660
Song Yiqiu.

279
18:48.270 --> 18:49.400
Let's

280
18:51.330 --> 18:52.480
be together again.

281
18:56.550 --> 18:59.240
Now we know that the tree spirit belongs to the Osmanthus Clan.

282
18:59.240 --> 19:00.710
We have to find the map of our pact

283
19:00.710 --> 19:01.970
and return to where it all began.

284
19:01.970 --> 19:04.030
Only then can we end our immortality.

285
19:07.080 --> 19:07.880
So?

286
19:08.360 --> 19:10.810
We are where it all began.

287
19:11.510 --> 19:12.310
Song Yiqiu.

288
19:12.680 --> 19:14.390
We began this immortal life together.

289
19:14.390 --> 19:15.080
Then let's

290
19:16.400 --> 19:17.190
end it together.
